# JRPG architecture

Turn-based / strategy JRPG. Full notes: `Assets/Docs/Architecture.md`.

## Deps

`KVH.Game` → `KVH.KylePixelator` → URP. Pixelator never imports Game. No extra asmdefs until a real cycle exists.

## Folders = namespaces

`Assets/Scripts/Runtime/<Feature>/` → `KVH.Game.<Feature>`. Name the job (`PlayerMotor`, `Interactable`), not `XxxManager`. Scene roots: `PixelCamera`, `GameInput`, `GameFlow`, `GameUI`, `Player`.

## Modes

`GameFlow.Mode` is Exploration / Menu / Battle. Battle code lives in `Combat/`, not `if (inBattle)` inside `PlayerMotor`. Freeze the pawn with `PlayerMotor.Busy` — dialogue/UI set it; they do not call `Move()`.

## UI

**uGUI** overlay (`UiRoot`, Screen Space Overlay). HUD/inventory/menus are children of `GameUI`. Never HUD/OnGUI inside `LowResOutput` or `PixelPresentCamera` (cullingMask 0). Do not add UI Toolkit unless uGUI is actually bursting.

## Don't

God `GameManager`, event bus, DI, interfaces before a second consumer, Find in a loop, item logic in Button OnClick.
